      "decision": "Adopt OpenVid only as an optional architectural/reference provider and pattern source behind existing FA3 video/editorial/compositing authorities. Do not vendor or admit the PolyForm Noncommercial upstream as baseline/commercial production runtime.",
      "rationale": [
        "browser-local deterministic compositing and product-demo workflow is useful to FA3",
        "hardware→software→WASM fallback and direct-to-disk patterns are reusable",
        "existing FA3 video/editorial/compositing profiles already own the capability",
        "PolyForm Noncommercial licensing forbids treating upstream as unrestricted production dependency"
      ],
